## Overview

The workflow is:

1. Generate cosmological training data.
2. Perform PCA compression of the power spectra.
3. Train a neural network to predict the PCA coefficients from cosmological parameters.
4. Reconstruct the full power spectra from the predicted PCA coefficients.
5. Validate the emulator against the original theoretical calculation.
6. Use the trained emulator within the Planck likelihood to efficiently sample cosmological parameters.

